      "content": "i don't know if anyone wants to hear it. it's just the same old thing. i was thinking, if i've already lost everything that makes me 'me', maybe there's no point in being a passenger at all. wouldn't it be better to just... decide when the ride is over? instead of just waiting for the engine to fail?",
